NOTICE — third-party content in this repository

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers everything in this repository except one thing: the
recorded third-party responses in eval/cassettes/. Stated as an exception and not as a list
of directories, because a list goes stale the first time one is added — an earlier edition
of this paragraph enumerated src/, tests, scripts, docs/ and the root, and left cv/ and the
rest of eval/ answered by neither half.

Those files hold job-board pages retrieved verbatim from the URLs below, stored so the
published evaluation tables reproduce offline with no API key and no network. The pages
remain their publishers' work. They are redistributed here under no grant from the
copyright holder named in LICENSE, as a reproducibility artifact rather than as part of
the licensed software: what this repository offers under MIT is the code, and the recorded
pages travel with it on their publishers' terms rather than on ours.

